<title>USA: Encad Inc Q4 net rises.</title>
<headline>Encad Inc Q4 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>SAN DIEGO 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>(Dollars in thousands, except per share data)</p>
<p>					     Quarter ended December 31,</p>
<p>							 1996	 1995</p>
<p> Net sales			    $33,020   100%  17,752   100%</p>
<p> Cost of sales			 16,953    51%  10,138    57%</p>
<p> Gross profit			  16,067    49%   7,614    43%</p>
<p>Operating expenses:</p>
<p>   Marketing and selling	    4,766    14%   2,466    14%</p>
<p>   Research and development	 2,858     9%   1,404     8%</p>
<p>   General and administrative     1,979     6%   1,082     6%</p>
<p>    Total operating expenses	9,603    29%   4,952    28%</p>
<p> Income from operations	     6,464    20%   2,662    15%</p>
<p> Interest income			   56     0%	57     0%</p>
<p> Income before income taxes	 6,520    20%   2,719    15%</p>
<p> Provision for income taxes	 2,303     7%     877     5%</p>
<p> Net income			     4,217    13%   1,842    10%</p>
<p> Earnings per share:		    .35		.16</p>
<p>Weighted average common</p>
<p>and common equivalent</p>
<p>   shares (in thousands)	   12,046	   11,324</p>
<p>Adjusted to reflect 2 for 1 stock split effective May 31, 1996.</p>
</text>
